{'symbol': 'RCL', 'date': '2022-02-04 07:59:00', 'title': 'ROYAL CARIBBEAN GROUP REPORTS ON 2021 RESULTS, PROVIDES BUSINESS UPDATE', 'text': 'MIAMI, FEB. 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROYAL CARIBBEAN GROUP (NYSE: RCL) TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE 2021 FISCAL YEAR AND PROVIDED BUSINESS UPDATES.\xa0 "2021 MARKED THE BEGINNING OF OUR RETURN TO OUR MISSION OF DELIVERING THE VERY BEST VACATION EXPERIENCES," SAID JASON LIBERTY, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF THE ROYAL CARIBBEAN GROUP.'}